card.text:
When this Equipment enters, scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom and the rest on top in any order.)
During your turn, equipped creature has first strike.
Equip {2}

When this Equipment enters, create a 1/1 white Hero creature token with renown 1, then attach this equipment to it. (When that creature deals combat damage to a player, if it isn't renowned, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes renowned.)
Equipped creature gets +1/+1. As long as it's renowned, it has menace.
Equip {2}
